cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Roro
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jabez
    family-names: Kok
abstract: >-
  Roro is a standalone security proxy for the Model Context Protocol (MCP).
  It checks every tool call an AI agent makes against Cedar policy, can ask a
  person before a risky call runs, keeps a hash-chained and signed audit log,
  and can stop an agent at any time.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/timeomy/roro'
url: 'https://www.roro.im'
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.0
date-released: '2026-11-24'
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - ai-agents
  - security
  - cedar
  - audit-log
